00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:20.000
during mid-cycle rotations when growth stocks pause. The risk is that cost savings prove temporary

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.820
if utilization spikes later in the year. Use your broker's earning surprise scanner filtered

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:30.560
for healthcare. Cross-check the revised guidance language in the release itself.

